{"id":"random_projection_embedding_similarity","title":"Fixed Gaussian projection embedding similarity","family":"embedding","definition":"reference","intro_en":"Multiply both 16-coordinate inputs by the same six-by-16 Gaussian matrix. Each output coordinate is a weighted sum of all observations. The matrix is fixed by an explicit random seed, allowing the comparison to be reproduced without fitting a neural encoder. Cosine compares vector direction and is defined here for nonzero feature vectors.","intro_zh":"将两个 16 维输入乘以同一个六乘十六高斯矩阵。每个输出坐标都是全部观测的加权和。矩阵由明确的随机种子固定，因此无需拟合神经编码器也可复现比较。 余弦比较向量方向，本例特征向量均非零。","steps_en":["Use the same fixed matrix with entries N(0,1/6) to project both inputs to six dimensions.","Collect the computed coordinates in the same fixed order for both inputs.","Normalize by both vector lengths and sum coordinate products to obtain cosine similarity.","Interpret the score in this representation, accounting for the information it discards."],"steps_zh":["使用同一个元素分布为 N(0,1/6) 的固定矩阵，把两条输入投影到六维。","把计算得到的坐标按同一个固定顺序组成两个向量。","用两个向量的长度归一化坐标乘积之和，得到余弦相似度。","结合表示所舍弃的信息，在该表示空间中解释分数。"],"animation_steps_en":["Multiply both inputs by the same fixed Gaussian matrix.","Collect matching coordinates in the same vector order.","Normalize vector products to obtain cosine similarity.","Read the score in this feature space, with its stated information loss."],"formula":"s(x,y) = dot(phi(x),phi(y)) / (norm(phi(x))*norm(phi(y)))","caveats_en":["The six-dimensional example has no asserted distortion guarantee. Johnson-Lindenstrauss guarantees require dimensions and probability assumptions tied to a finite point set.","Changing the random seed changes the representation; a shared matrix and identical input length/order are essential.","Cosine ignores positive rescaling of the entire feature vector; 1-cosine is generally not a metric, and zero vectors require an explicit policy."],"caveats_zh":["本例六维投影不声称满足给定失真保证。Johnson-Lindenstrauss 保证需要维数、概率与有限样本集等条件。","改变随机种子会改变表示；必须共享矩阵并保持输入长度及顺序一致。","余弦忽略整个特征向量的正比例缩放；1-cosine 通常不满足度量公理，零向量还需明确处理规则。"],"sources":[{"label":"scikit-learn: Gaussian random projection","url":"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/random_projection.html"},{"label":"Exact illustrative inputs and encoder definitions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/tools/method_animation_data/feature_model_embedding.py"}],"x":[0.0,0.8769216919004693,0.8094744111674236,0.7863961030678929,0.3905255888325767,-0.5769216919004693,-0.6000000000000001,-0.09587051423531628,0.2094744111674235,1.0863961030678926,1.5905255888325764,0.9958705142353173,0.6000000000000002,0.20412948576468337,-0.39052558883257615,0.11360389693210537],"y":[-0.2003300858899106,0.185,0.5703300858899106,1.005,1.0003300858899107,0.3250000000000002,-0.35033008588991066,-0.3550000000000001,0.07966991411008931,0.46499999999999997,0.8503300858899105,1.2849999999999995,1.2803300858899114,0.6050000000000002,-0.07033008588991083,-0.07500000000000043],"input_label":"Deterministic synthetic teaching signals, 16 samples each","parameters":{"seed":20261029,"matrix_shape":[6,16],"entry_variance":0.16666666666666666,"matrix":[[-0.5194508388046408,0.6925531409100528,0.5276738178253589,0.3421103162417348,-0.24189739800758292,-0.9318042670330671,-0.34699445019019953,0.14895157038933,0.6577606001663231,-0.21587247502476686,-0.2105641686898666,-0.015183263110597449,-0.20443004209346777,-0.10526240498773033,-0.5486230062454652,0.4718299455848165],[0.2327057158176952,0.6454625109247026,-0.12318259251046923,0.25288704457474365,0.5299530066457878,0.14748919107826164,-0.5529611921267462,-0.7973348966527448,-0.08858696791282737,0.3087051680423722,-0.007836755555181388,0.019690312134448135,0.006657913594121614,0.3019453761132193,-0.19151184428095228,-0.13148287000823003],[0.21955486202821017,0.48781296520432166,0.07854972933328519,0.02919957197589381,0.6884227119244153,-0.09857667067434531,-0.5437985569677152,-0.4491742559455326,0.08120241246922642,0.3630345341848169,0.309083